  "description": "OWAREK crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C44 H101 O11 Tb3. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.526-3.593 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.29-101.12°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb3(μ3-OtBu)2(μ2-OtBu)3(OtBu)4(HOtBu)2].",
